 41→            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#008060" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width:16px;height:16px"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
